{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>PennyWise Pro 是一款功能全面的個人理財應用，旨在讓開支追蹤與預算管理變得輕鬆簡單。無論您是為目標儲蓄，還是想了解金錢流向，它都能提供清晰的概覽與控制。目前正在限時免費，原價 US $0.99，機會難得。</p>\n\n<h2>智能理財功能</h2>\n<p>PennyWise Pro 提供智能儀表板，讓您一眼掌握今日收支、每月預算進度與持續記錄天數。您可以快速記錄交易、設定週期性帳單提醒，並透過互動式圓餅圖與趨勢圖分析消費習慣。支援多種貨幣與 8 種語言，並透過 iCloud 在 Apple 裝置間同步。資料以 Face ID 或 Touch ID 保護，並可匯出 CSV、JSON 或 PDF。主屏幕小工具讓您無需開啟應用即可查看預算進度。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-865-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-866-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-867-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-868-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-869-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-870-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：PennyWise Pro</li>\n<li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-15T10:38:30.353520+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":360,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}